          <Pad Id="LnyxQGG5uGm5RIZvUPM5OI" Bounds="580,380,320,62" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Drawing a hull around moving points is the cheap way to show where a crowd is. A hull around a polygon fills in its dents.">
